:''Not to be confused with [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Assassin BearCat]].''
'''Assassin Bear''' (ブラックマ, ''Burakkuma'', '''Black Bear''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Teacher Bear]] that appears in [[Challenge Battle]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

